  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 50165771b94f1084888177478ff839ed, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BedroomOpening
  playerMovement: {fileID: 1071646419}
  openingDialogue:
  - ...!
  - That dream again...
  - Why does it always feel so real?
  - ...
  - 'I''m Evelyn.

'
  - Lately, I've been having the same dream over and over again.
  - A voice keeps calling out to me...
  - '"You promised."'
  - I don't know why...
  - But every time I hear those words, I think of Lucia.
  - My little sister.
  - ...
  - Maybe I should clear my head.
  - Looking around the room might help.
  - Maybe something here will help me understand that dream.
  dialogueDelay: 0.8
