--- !u!114 &211345131
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 211345129}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9d20f203c72c97c4b8a8b0c304417efb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DiaryManager
  diaryPanel: {fileID: 1195227592}
  memoryImage: {fileID: 318152046}
  diaryText: {fileID: 887328070}
  previousButton: {fileID: 1305089479}
  nextButton: {fileID: 1370065373}
  page1Image: {fileID: 4984922591012299491, guid: 37774bf568d5fba48a3d4566879827f2, type: 3}
  page1Text: 'April 12


    I went up the hill again tonight.


    The city was
    still bright after sunset.

    There were people everywhere.


    Nobody seemed
    to care what anyone else was wearing, or where they were going.


    I wonder
    what it feels like to go somewhere without having to explain yourself.


    Maybe
    one day I''ll find out.'
  page2Image: {fileID: -6094493667856492930, guid: df55986944964cb47af8c0f5254dab3f, type: 3}
  page2Text: 'April 18


    We argued again during dinner.

    Mom asked why I
    keep talking about leaving town after graduation.

    Dad said everything I
    need is already here.


    They even found a job for me.

    Nobody asked if
    I wanted it.


    Mom said they''re only thinking about my future.

    I know
    they mean well.

    I just wish they''d ask what I want.


    Lucia stayed
    quiet.

    But she kept looking at me.'
  page3Image: {fileID: -826106604323677768, guid: ea9a341f36f702d4dbe2eea94f402d16, type: 3}
  page3Text: "April 25\n\nI went into town alone today.\nMrs. Carter asked why I
    was dressed like that.\nSomeone else asked Mom if I was \u201Cgoing through a
    phase.\u201D\n\nI don't know why everyone here needs to know everything.\nWhere
    I go.\nWhat I wear.\nWho I'm with.\n\nSometimes this whole town feels like another
    room in our house.\n\nJust with more windows."
  page4Image: {fileID: -5922790386329682662, guid: b27a17ba77e4dac49909123e71ed3424, type: 3}
  page4Text: "May 3\n\nLucia came into my room again tonight.\n\nShe asked if I really
    wanted to leave this town.\nI told her I did.\n\nThen she asked where I would
    go.\nI said I didn't know.\nSomewhere far away, maybe.\nShe was quiet for a while.\n\nThen
    she asked,\n\u201CCan I come with you?\u201D\nI laughed and said,\n\u201COf course.\u201D\n\nI
    think she believed me."
  page5Image: {fileID: -4018336208290875845, guid: 8931786757280034b8fb2389aa4020e2, type: 3}
  page5Text: 'May 10


    I don''t hate them.

    I don''t hate this house.

    I
    don''t even hate this town.

    I just don''t want this to be my whole life.


    I
    want to choose where I go.

    What I wear.

    Who I become.


    Lucia never
    asked me to stay.

    She only asked me not to leave her behind.

    I promised
    her.


    But if freedom means leaving something behind...

    what am I supposed
    to leave?'
  keyItem:
    itemName: Key
    icon: {fileID: 1694913177206695654, guid: ce8c4129d0700144592f244f4ac6ce90, type: 3}
    description: An old key hidden inside the diary.
  keyFoundDialogue:
  - ...Wait.
  - There's something between the pages.
  - A key...?
