  - She always told me it was nothing.
  - And I believed her...
  - No.
  - Maybe I just wanted to believe her.
  - I knew she was hurting.
  - But I didn't know it had gotten this bad.
  - '"Is Evelyn coming back?"'
  - Lucia...
  - What happened while I was gone?
