    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'April 12


    I went up the hill again tonight.


    The city was still
    bright after sunset.

    There were people everywhere.


    Nobody seemed to
    care what anyone else was wearing, or where they were going.


    I wonder what
    it feels like to go somewhere without having to explain yourself.


    Maybe
    one day I''ll find out.'
